start: mr
R1: 3ch=tr {2tr 3ch [3tr 3ch]x3}@ring join turn
R2: sl@sp 3ch=tr {2tr 3ch 3tr}@same 1ch [{3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner 1ch]x3 join turn
R3: sl@sp 3ch=tr 2tr@same 1ch [{3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner 1ch 3sk 3tr@sp 1ch 3sk]x3 {3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner 1ch 3sk join turn
R4: sl@sp 3ch=tr 2tr@same 1ch 3sk [{3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner 1ch [3sk 3tr@sp 1ch]x2 3sk]x3 {3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner 1ch 3sk 3tr@sp 1ch 3sk join turn
R5: sl@sp 3ch=tr 2tr@same 1ch [3sk 3tr@sp 1ch]x2 3sk [{3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner 1ch 3sk [3tr@sp 1ch 3sk]x2]x3 {3tr 3ch 3tr}@corner [1ch 3sk 3tr@sp]x3 1ch join turn
